State: +
  Note:
  This file is the entry point for the
  security control layer. Security is not just a skill or a stage —
  it is a cross-cutting control layer that applies to every stage of
  the SDLC. The security layer coordinates with existing security
  content in chains, tasks, skills, and project files.

